{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53610","headline":"和入京 · 吕让","name":"和入京","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"俘囚经万里，憔悴度三春。\n发改河阳鬓，衣余京洛尘。\n锺仪悲去楚，随会泣留秦。\n既谢（一作「得」）平吴利，终成失路人。\n（见《文苑英华》卷二四○）（按：《古诗纪》、《全隋诗》及逯钦立辑《先秦汉魏晋南北朝诗》皆收此诗爲隋诗，实误。\n隋无吕让其人，《文苑英华》另收吕让大和八年作《楚州刺史厅记》，可证。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕让","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53610.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53610","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}